        "text_RfEgrF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Once tattooed skin has moved beyond peeling and recovery, the focus shifts to long-term moisture, softness, and maintaining the appearance of the artwork.</p><p>Dry, rough, itchy, or uneven-feeling skin can be a sign that the skin is not retaining moisture as effectively as it should. This becomes especially common as skin ages, when natural oil production and moisture retention may decline. The skin’s natural lipid-and-water barrier helps reduce moisture loss while protecting against everyday environmental stressors.</p><p>Daily Tattoo Salve helps support this natural moisture barrier, reducing the look and feel of dryness, roughness, and tightness while keeping tattooed skin soft, smooth, and comfortable. With consistent use, it also helps keep tattoos looking more vibrant, conditioned, and well cared for — without a heavy or sticky finish.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
